            "review_title": "Review at VietCharm",
            "review_text": "Vacation26978303113\n1 contribution\n0\nThe Best Cultural Show in TP.HCM\nJul 2026 • Friends\nFirst time watching the show and feeling more than expected. After each show there will be a dish served to the audience. Over the course of two hours, the items and dishes from the three northern parts - Central and South - not only made the audience satisfied but also surprised because they carried Vietnamese cultural identity. This is not only a destination for Vietnamese but also a lot of foreign visitors. Next to the stage is the area to rent clothes for the audience to become and live in an old palace party space 10/10\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 14, 2026",
